":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041203010:1":{"text":"正直に言うと、あの時はあなたのことを羨んでたのよ。","source_cn":"老实说，那时候我还很羡慕你呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28E7458C7FEFDC2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041203011:1":{"text":"……私を？どうして？","source_cn":"……羡慕我？为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x996D8622B475F4EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041203012:1":{"text":"あなたは、めったにないほどの魔法の才能を持ってて、卒業するなり賢者に認められた人なのよ。羨ましいに決まってるでしょう？","source_cn":"既有难得一见的魔法天赋，又在刚刚毕业后就得到了贤者的赏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A5D5B31EF8C1C2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1041203012":{"text":"あなたは、めったにないほどの魔法の才能を持ってて、卒業するなり賢者に認められた人なのよ。羨ましいに決まってるでしょう？","source_cn":"既有难得一见的魔法天赋，又在刚刚毕业后就得到了贤者的赏识。谁不羡慕你？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A5D5B31EF8C1C2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041203013:1":{"text":"えぇ、今のイミルは森に危害を加えるなんて許しがたいことをしてますが、昔の彼は正真正銘の賢者だったし、パリーサへのサポートも……きっと本心だったはずです。","source_cn":"嗯，虽然现在的伊米尔危害丛林，罪无可恕，但以前的他还称...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84613840AB0283AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_recor